OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be dry with variable
OL,8,Famounts of cloud and some clear
OL,9,Fperiods. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,12,Fwith some good spells of sunshine.
OL,13,FFeeling warm, but a cooler onshore
OL,14,Fbreeze along the coast.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,17,FCloudier on Tuesday with a chance of
OL,18,Fshowers. Some longer spells of rain
OL,19,Fare likely to extend north at times on
OL,20,FWednesday and Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
